@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Running Automated Tests in Pipelines";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <p class="lead text-center">Automate your testing process in CI/CD pipelines to enhance software quality and speed up delivery.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Automated testing in CI/CD pipelines ensures that your application functions correctly before deployment.
            By integrating test suites into your build and release pipelines, teams can detect issues early and improve software reliability.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/automated-testing-overview.jpg" alt="Automated Testing Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Automated testing helps maintain high code quality in continuous integration workflows.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Types of Automated Tests -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Types of Automated Tests in Pipelines</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Unit Tests:</strong> Test individual components or functions for expected behavior.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Integration Tests:</strong> Ensure different modules work together as intended.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Functional Tests:</strong> Validate business logic and workflows.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Performance Tests:</strong> Measure system response times and stability.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Security Tests:</strong> Identify vulnerabilities and enforce security best practices.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Setting Up Automated Tests in Azure Pipelines -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">Setting Up Automated Tests in Azure Pipelines</h2>
        <p>Follow these steps to integrate automated tests in Azure Pipelines:</p>
        <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
            <li class="list-group-item">Define test cases using a framework like NUnit, JUnit, or Selenium.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Ensure your tests are included in the source repository.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Modify your pipeline YAML file to include test execution steps.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Run the pipeline and analyze test results in Azure DevOps.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-pipelines-tests.jpg" alt="Azure Pipelines Automated Testing" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure Pipelines enable seamless integration of automated tests.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Best Practices -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Best Practices for Automated Testing</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Run Tests Early & Often:</strong> Catch issues before they reach production.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Use Parallel Execution:</strong> Speed up test execution using multiple agents.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Ensure Test Isolation:</strong> Avoid dependencies between test cases.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Automate Test Reporting:</strong> Generate detailed reports and logs for debugging.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-secondary">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Incorporating automated testing in CI/CD pipelines enhances software quality, accelerates releases, and ensures a seamless user experience.
            By leveraging tools like Azure Pipelines, teams can efficiently integrate and manage automated tests within their workflows.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/test-success.jpg" alt="CI/CD Test Success" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Automated testing in pipelines leads to more reliable and secure applications.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>